  "description": "Take on the unknown with the GrandTeton-Pro All-terrain Electric Assist Bicycle. Conquer the trails in Galaxy Silver/Lava Red or Coke Black and experience a new level of adventure. With its powerful motor and versatile design, this bike will push you to your limits!\nKey Features:\nSize Options: One regular size for a personalized and comfortable riding experience.\nHydraulic Disc Brake: Tektro Hydraulic Disc Brake braking system provides superior stopping power, ensuring your safety amidst any uncertainties even on long trips and at high speeds. Paired with a 203mm rotor, it ensures a smoother journey for every rider.\nPowerful Motor with Torque Sensor for All Terrains: Equipped with Vanpowers' robust 750W motor, this bike consistently delivers potent power, along with torque sensor, making it capable of tackling all kinds of terrains. It's ready for your fun and exciting adventures..\nShimano 9-speed Derailleur: Equipped with a 9-speed Shimano Cues gearbox, this bike offers the right gear setup for any situation, whether it's climbing a hill or navigating flat terrain.\nLong-Lasting Battery: Equiped with UL certified 710Wh batteries powered by LG cells that last for approximately 80-100 miles range. To ensure 100% safety, each battery uses a Vanpowers BMS (Battery Management System) to optimize heat control.\nAll-terrain Fat Tires: 26' x 4.0, with double-layer hub design.Gives it versatility, superb grip, whether it's the beach, snow or rugged mountain roads\nAir Suspension Fork: The air front fork with 130mm travel offers tremendous versatility for traversing bushes, hills, and gravel. Its super-long travel ensures every ride is as smooth as if you were on paved roads.\nFenders and Rear Rack: Pre-installed fenders protect you on rough mountain trails in all weather conditions, while the included rear rack lets you carry what you need with you.\nSturdy Build: Weighing at 32kg, the bike offers a solid and stable foundation for your all-terrain adventures.\nSafety Certified: Complies with UL 2849 and CPSC | 16-CFR-2015 standards, ensuring the utmost safety and reliability.\n\nElevate your commuting experience with the GrandTeton-Pro. Whether you're navigating city streets or exploring scenic routes, this electric assist bicycle combines style, performance, and safety for an unparalleled riding experience.",
